  6.2. Navigation layouts
  6.3. Dropdown menu
  6.4. Mobile menu
7. Card
8. Header
  8.1. Magazine layout
  8.2. Highlight layout
  8.3. Classic layout
9. CTA
10. Featured posts
11. Container
